    "Input: x = [[1.0, 2.0], [3.0, 4.0]], kernel = [[1.0, 0.5], [0.5, 1.0]]\n\nOutput: [[1.0, 2.5, 1.0], [3.5, 7.5, 4.0], [1.5, 5.0, 4.0]]\n\nExplanation: Evaluated cv_conv2d_transpose under standard test conditions."
